WEBVTT

00:15.386 --> 00:20.429
The camera's on, the smile is bright

00:22.870 --> 00:27.552
Another take in the burning light

00:30.165 --> 00:34.066
They painted the set with a perfect blue But it

00:34.126 --> 00:38.288
doesn't feel real, it doesn't feel true We're

00:38.328 --> 00:43.350
living under a plastic sky They tell me jump, I

00:43.450 --> 00:50.152
ask how high It's just a set, it's all a lie Living

00:50.972 --> 00:54.614
under a plastic sky

00:55.534 --> 00:57.215
Woah

00:59.493 --> 01:04.016
My guitar is clean, the drums are thin.

01:07.118 --> 01:11.300
They polished away all the grit and sin.

01:15.015 --> 01:19.737
I wanna scream, I wanna roar But they just ask me

01:19.817 --> 01:24.739
to sing some more We're living under a plastic

01:24.799 --> 01:30.341
sky They tell me jump, I ask how high It's just a

01:30.401 --> 01:37.303
set, it's all a lie Living under a plastic sky

01:41.359 --> 01:45.802
Is this the dream we were chasing? A different

01:45.883 --> 01:50.686
part, a different face. I'm losing me, I'm

01:50.766 --> 01:54.669
losing you.

01:55.130 --> 02:00.814
You know I love Chastity.

02:17.716 --> 02:22.059
We're living under a plastic sky They tell me

02:22.099 --> 02:28.123
jump, I ask how high It's just a set, it's all a lie

02:28.583 --> 02:38.690
Living under a plastic sky Plastic sky

02:38.750 --> 02:43.232
Feeling so

02:43.393 --> 02:45.183
loose ♪

